      <h1>I architect solutions to operational problems in financial services — and I know how much automation each one actually warrants.</h1>
      <p class="subline">Twenty-one years turning high-stakes, manual financial workflows into systems that run themselves. I work with development architects and product owners to get the design right — and I came up through the code, so <em>right</em> means buildable. Lately: where agentic AI belongs, and where it doesn't.</p>
